    "allocation": "No per-tree AGB is invented. The stand-level AGB is applied to the plot on a per-hectare basis and scaled by observed_merchantable_all / BTC_volume so the AGB and the pilot log volume are on the same plot productivity basis. Merchantable log biomass is expanded from sampled trees by PHF_TREE and then by observed all-tree/sampled-tree merchantable volume. The unscaled AGB is retained for sensitivity.",
